  "ai_usage": "Fake audio activity for a music or podcast UI. The key is coprime durations per bar (.7s/.9s/1.1s…) — equal durations make the whole meter pulse as one. To make it real, replace the height animation with AnalyserNode data.",
  "path": "effects/loaders-spinners/spectrum-bars-loader.html",
  "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Spectrum Analyzer</title>\n  <script type=\"application/json\" id=\"effect-meta\">\n  {\n    \"id\": \"spectrum-bars-loader\",\n    \"title\": \"Spectrum Analyzer\",\n    \"summary\": \"A gradient-filled audio spectrum whose bars bob on staggered, unequal durations.\",\n    \"description\": \"Each bar gets its own duration and delay so the pattern never repeats visibly — the difference between 'audio meter' and 'CSS loop'.\",\n    \"theme\": \"loaders-spinners\",\n    \"categories\": [\"loader\", \"audio\"],\n    \"tags\": [\"equalizer\", \"spectrum\", \"audio\", \"bars\", \"gradient\"],\n    \"tech\": [\"css\"],\n    \"era\": \"2020s\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"beginner\",\n    \"dependencies\": [],\n    \"browser_support\": \"All modern browsers (Chromium, Firefox, Safari).\",\n    \"performance_notes\": \"Lightweight — composited transform/opacity work only.\",\n    \"accessibility_notes\": \"Decorative status indicator — pair it with a visually-hidden aria-live message so screen readers announce the wait. Motion stops under prefers-reduced-motion.\",\n    \"customization\": [\n      { \"name\": \"--a\", \"description\": \"Low frequency color\", \"default\": \"#7c5cff\" },\n      { \"name\": \"--b\", \"description\": \"High frequency color\", \"default\": \"#2dd4bf\" }\n    ],\n    \"variations\": [\"Mirror the bars for a symmetric meter\", \"Add a peak-hold cap per bar\", \"Drive heights from the Web Audio API\"],\n    \"ai_usage\": \"Fake audio activity for a music or podcast UI. The key is coprime durations per bar (.7s/.9s/1.1s…) — equal durations make the whole meter pulse as one. To make it real, replace the height animation with AnalyserNode data.\"\n  }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }\n    body { display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0b0d12; color: #e7ebf3;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }\n    :root { --a: #7c5cff; --b: #2dd4bf; }\n    .eq { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 5px; height: 76px; }\n    .eq i { width: 8px; border-radius: 3px 3px 2px 2px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--b), var(--a));\n      animation: bob var(--d) ease-in-out infinite alternate; height: 22%; transform-origin: bottom; }\n    @keyframes bob { from { height: 16%; } to { height: 100%; } }\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      * { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"eq\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Loading\">\n    <i style=\"--d:.62s\"></i><i style=\"--d:.94s\"></i><i style=\"--d:.74s\"></i><i style=\"--d:1.12s\"></i>\n    <i style=\"--d:.86s\"></i><i style=\"--d:.68s\"></i><i style=\"--d:1.02s\"></i><i style=\"--d:.78s\"></i>\n    <i style=\"--d:.9s\"></i><i style=\"--d:.66s\"></i>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
